# In travel the weight of globe, backdrop, corona shell and prominence card is globeShare(distance), and the
#   far Sun's pass is drawn over the globe with one minus it. The flattening knobs of `leave` are out.
# On dispose the set takes its map back (farSun.wear(null)).
